WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.714
I was just really struck by the human,
relatable aspects of her describing her

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:09.009
first kiss and being a new kid at school
and becoming a mother.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:11.594
And I was really surprised
with how relatable it is

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:14.139
and these kind of universal

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.348
moments that we all go through.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:20.145
But in this really unique world of
Graceland with Elvis, it's the first time

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:23.773
I've had that, or I had to be torn
between my creative expression

00:00:23.773 --> 00:00:25.316
and also the responsibility
of I'm telling

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:28.486
someone else's story who's alive
and I want them to feel good about it.

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:30.572
So I always had that in mind.

